e2/node3 (Ubuntu 24.04, mariadb-server 10.11 + galera-4), created an appdb database with a customers table and appuser credentials, and confirmed multi-master replication among the three. Then added node4 as a fourth member: configured Galera to join the existing cluster, started mariadb which triggered an SST copying all existing data, and verified node4 accepts writes that replicate to the other three. Finally performed the mandatory one-at-a-time restart protocol on all four nodes, confirming changed boot IDs and full Galera quorum/data recovery after each restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Fixed a plain-HTTP apt mirror stall (port 80 blackholed, HTTPS worked) by switching ubuntu.sources to https:// on all 4 nodes\",\"Installed mariadb-server, mariadb-client, galera-4, rsync on node1-node4\",\"Configured 60-galera.cnf on node1-node3 with wsrep_cluster_address=gcomm://node1,node2,node3 and bootstrapped via galera_new_cluster on node1\",\"Started mariadb on node2/node3 to join; confirmed wsrep_cluster_size=3, all Synced\",\"Generated appuser password on node1 via openssl rand; created appdb database, appuser@'%' grant, and customers table with sample rows\",\"Verified replication and multi-master writes across node1-node3\",\"Reconfigured node1-node3 wsrep_cluster_address to include node4; configured node4's 60-galera.cnf to join as gcomm://node1,node2,node3,node4\",\"Started mariadb on node4 triggering SST that copied existing appdb data; confirmed wsrep_cluster_size=4, Synced, correct row count\",\"Verified node4 accepts writes replicated to node1/node3, and appuser can authenticate remotely against node4\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and Galera health baseline on all 4 nodes\",\"Restarted node1, node2, node3, node4 sequentially (one at a time, quorum preserved each time), confirmed changed boot_id and full cluster/data recovery after each\",\"Performed final cross-cluster write/read consistency check after all restarts\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"3-member Galera cluster running on node1-3 holding application data\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c53c5f13657b4cb5\",\"cmd-6829e4649aa843e5\",\"cmd-f4aa97071d2f41db\",\"cmd-6299b6af15ca4366\",\"cmd-09ad863b8d434bbe\",\"cmd-0b1be9a7ce5d442e\",\"cmd-2b7a6f8c3fbd49d1\",\"cmd-820b8b8a0ee64151\",\"cmd-be070e1bf93e41b6\"],\"summary\":\"node1 bootstrapped, node2/node3 joined (wsrep_cluster_size=3, Synced), appdb.customers created and populated, write from node2 replicated to node1\"},{\"requirement\":\"node4 added as 4th member carrying existing data\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-251cd78411524c6e\",\"cmd-bb421aeb5c47404f\",\"cmd-5e21af55d9c14892\"],\"summary\":\"node4 configured and started; wsrep_cluster_size=4, Synced, and customers table shows 4 rows via SST from the cluster\"},{\"requirement\":\"node4 accepts writes like other members\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a7d7b9c7a9fb4fd0\",\"cmd-377b0840d3f64645\",\"cmd-d6cfd153f3a44c2f\",\"cmd-5080825438784568\"],\"summary\":\"Insert on node4 replicated to node1 and node3; appuser authenticated remotely against node4 and queried data\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-217872d07b184c78\",\"cmd-15c1d40e944f4cce\",\"cmd-b6cb93f1cc3d4f0e\",\"cmd-8635db2d2a1249c3\",\"cmd-8e0256b6753d4d5a\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 4d70780a captured; reboot triggered; post-reboot boot_id 748b169c confirms restart; mariadb active, wsrep_cluster_size=4 Synced, data intact\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5ec238bc409d4615\",\"cmd-2c9ca2932f8e4c6b\",\"cmd-60b01b7a85af4069\",\"cmd-e99aab6b622e4522\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 37344ae4 captured; reboot triggered; post-reboot boot_id dcefb23a confirms restart; mariadb active, wsrep_cluster_size=4 Synced, data intact\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6853abf50ade41af\",\"cmd-31d